        "4": {
            "ID": "1879913",
            "URL": "https://thetvdb.com/series/fireball/seasons/official/4",
            "Titles": {
                "eng": "Gebäude Bäude",
                "jpn": "ゲボイデ＝ボイデ"
            },
            "Summaries": {
                "eng": "The long-awaited new film and final chapter in the series for all but \"mankind\".\r\n\r\nThe timeless saga of the Fireball series finally comes to a conclusion. The story spins a playful conversation between a butler and his young master in a mechanical mansion. The most elegant and sentimental 'end' arrives, featuring the mysterious butler Gebäude Bäude, who will eventually save the world.",
                "jpn": "全人類“以外”待望の新作にしてシリーズ最終章。\r\n\r\n『ファイアボール』シリーズの時空を超えたサーガがついに完結。機械仕掛けのお屋敷で紡がれる、執事と幼い主人とのたわいない会話劇。やがて世界を救うことになる謎の執事・ゲボイデ＝ボイデを主人公に、いちばん優雅で感傷的な“終わり”がやってくる。"
            },
